---

---

<div
    id="interactive-experience-wrap"
    class="w-full text-white flex items-center flex-col bg-no-repeat bg-cover"
    style="background-image:url('images/01_Image_BG_01.webp');background-position-y: -20rem;background-color:#060103;"
>
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px]">
        <div class="flex flex-col backdrop-blur-xl py-8 items-center w-full">
            <div class="px-10 md:px-[28%]">
                <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center py-4">
                    The Interactive Experience
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="text-2xl text-center text-[#cb8337] py-4 subtitle-text-content"
                >
                    Today, we are going to discover the remarkable Mazda CX-60
                    and Mazda CX- 90 SUVs, vehicles that redefine elegance and
                    power, elevating the driving experience to new heights.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="main-text-wrap [background:linear-gradient(to_top,_black_70%,_transparent_80%)] sm:bg-none pt-[200px] md:pt-16 md:pb-16 xl:pt-14rem xl:pb-14rem xl:text-2xl flex justify-end"
        >
            <div
                class="pt-10 pb-0 px-10 md:pl-[8.4%] w-full md:w-1/2 right-text-content"
            >
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    As we guide you through the interactive experience, you'll
                    discover the cutting-edge features, unmatched performance,
                    and meticulous craftsmanship that set these flagship models
                    apart from the competition.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    But that's not all—be sure to click on the feature
                    presentation that delves into the essence of Mazda’s design
                    philosophy that harmonises sophistication with
                    functionality, embodying Mazda's commitment to excellence
                    and innovation.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="bg-[#ffffffa6] flex flex-col backdrop-blur-xl pt-6 pb-10 items-center w-full relative top-[10rem]"
    >
        <div class="w-full px-[8%] flex justify-center">
            <div class="chapter-nav-cards-wrapper">
                <h3
                    class="text-[2.75rem] leading-[3rem] text-black text-left flex mb-6 px-6 md:px-[8%]"
                >
                    <div class="mr-3 font-light">Click to select a chapter</div>
                    <img
                        class="h-12"
                        src="images/icon-mouse-cursor.png"
                        alt=""
                    />
                </h3>
                <div
                    class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 chapter-nav-cards px-6 md:px-[8%]"
                >
                    <a
                        href="#design"
                        class="w-full lg:w-1/4 h-[16rem] cursor-pointer rounded-xl relative bg-cover"
                        style="background-image:url('images/01_Thumbnail_Nav_01.webp');background-position-x:-4rem;"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[0.9rem] font-medium text-right absolute top-6 right-4"
                            >
                                DESIGN
                            </div>
                            <h4
                                class="text-3xl font-medium pr-8 absolute bottom-6 left-6"
                            >
                                Attractive from every angle
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="#interior"
                        class="w-full lg:w-1/4 h-[16rem] cursor-pointer rounded-xl relative bg-cover"
                        style="background-image:url('images/01_Thumbnail_Nav_02.webp');background-position-x:-4rem;"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[0.9rem] font-medium text-right absolute top-6 right-4"
                            >
                                INTERIOR
                            </div>
                            <h4
                                class="text-3xl font-medium pr-8 absolute bottom-6 left-6"
                            >
                                Refined elegance
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="#features"
                        class="w-full lg:w-1/4 h-[16rem] cursor-pointer rounded-xl relative bg-cover"
                        style="background-image:url('images/01_Thumbnail_Nav_03.webp');background-position-x:-4rem;"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[0.9rem] font-medium text-right absolute top-6 right-4"
                            >
                                FEATURES AND TECHNOLOGY
                            </div>
                            <h4
                                class="text-3xl font-medium pr-8 absolute bottom-6 left-6"
                            >
                                Cutting-edge innovation
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a
                        href="#driving-experience"
                        class="w-full lg:w-1/4 h-[16rem] cursor-pointer rounded-xl relative bg-cover"
                        style="background-image:url('images/01_Thumbnail_Nav_04.webp');background-position-x:-4rem;"
                    >
                        <div>
                            <div
                                class="text-[0.9rem] font-medium text-right absolute top-6 right-4"
                            >
                                DRIVING EXPERIENCE
                            </div>
                            <h4
                                class="text-3xl font-medium pr-8 absolute bottom-6 left-6"
                            >
                                The unity of horse and rider
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .chapter-nav-cards a {
        background-size: cover;
        background-position-x: -4rem;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .chapter-nav-cards a > div {
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
    }
    .chapter-nav-cards a:hover > div {
        /* transform: scale(1.01); */
        /* filter: sepia(0.28); */
        background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        transition: ease-in-out 0.3s;
    }
    .chapter-nav-cards a h4 {
        color: white;
    }
    .chapter-nav-cards a div {
        color: white;
    }
    /* .chapter-nav-cards a:hover h4 {
        color: #cb8337;
    }
    .chapter-nav-cards a:hover div {
        color: #cb8337;
    } */
    .chapter-nav-cards a:hover::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        /* background */
    }

    .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper {
        min-width: 1200px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        .chapter-nav-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; /* Two columns of equal width */
            grid-template-rows: auto auto; /* Two rows */
            gap: 20px; /* Space between grid items */
            width: 70%; /* Container width, adjust as needed */
            margin: auto; /* Center the container horizontally */
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a {
            height: 18rem;
            background-color: #f0f0f0; /* Light grey background */
            padding: 20px; /* Padding inside each grid item */
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper h3 {
            margin-left: 15%;
        }
    }
    @media (max-width: 870px) {
        .chapter-nav-cards {
            gap: 10px; /* Space between grid items */
            width: 50%; /* Container width, adjust as needed */
            margin: auto; /* Center the container horizontally */
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a {
            height: 14rem;
            background-color: #f0f0f0; /* Light grey background */
            padding: 10px; /* Padding inside each grid item */
            text-align: center; /* Center text inside the grid item */
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper h3 {
            margin-left: 25%;
        }
        .right-text-content {
            padding-left: 5rem;
            padding-right: 5rem;
        }
        .subtitle-text-content {
            padding-left: 3rem;
            padding-right: 3rem;
        }
        .main-text-wrap {
            padding-top: 0;
            background: transparent !important;
        }
        #interactive-experience-wrap {
            background-position: top !important;
            background-size: cover !important;
        }
    }
    @media (max-width: 490px) {
        .chapter-nav-cards {
            gap: 10px; /* Space between grid items */
            width: 30%; /* Container width, adjust as needed */
            margin: auto; /* Center the container horizontally */
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a {
            height: 10rem;
            background-color: #f0f0f0; /* Light grey background */
            padding: 10px; /* Padding inside each grid item */
            text-align: left; /* Center text inside the grid item */
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a div {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            line-height: 1rem;
            right: 0.8rem;
            top: 0.5rem;
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a h4 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.2rem;
            left: 0.8rem;
            bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper h3 {
            margin-left: 35%;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        .right-text-content {
            padding-left: 2.5rem;
            padding-right: 2.5rem;
        }
        .subtitle-text-content {
            padding-left: 0rem;
            padding-right: 0rem;
        }
        .main-text-wrap {
            padding-top: 0;
        }
        #interactive-experience-wrap {
            background-position: top !important;
            background-size: cover !important;
        }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1400px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper {
            min-width: 1650px;
            padding: 0 8.4%;
        }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1600px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper {
            min-width: 1850px;
            padding: 0 8.4%;
        }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1800px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper {
            min-width: 1850px;
            padding: 0 8.4%;
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a {
            height: 18rem;
        }
    }
    @media (min-width: 2000px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        .chapter-nav-cards-wrapper {
            min-width: 2550px;
            padding: 0 8.4%;
        }
        .chapter-nav-cards a {
            height: 21rem;
        }
        right-text-content {
            padding-right: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
